 "storyArc": "Tomás remembers Sundays at the café when he was six: he used to sit on the counter while Rosa sang, and his father used to take him to see the planes. Then they moved to Toronto and the Sundays stopped. A woman at the counter recognises him from those Sundays: Mariana Cifuentes, the neighbour's daughter, now a journalist. She is investigating why Grupo Altamira is buying every old house in the area.",
